action: write_plan
respond: Plan written for Monday. I'll be here Monday morning ready to haggle and share samples—come by and say hi!
parameters: {"content": "Monday strategy: Protect the $20 entry fee first—do not overspend in restock before market opens. Keep prices as set (ceramic bowls, matcha, green tea, seaweed, etc.). No new supplier orders for Monday (standard orders arrive after two calendar days), so work with current inventory. Focus on high-margin and fast-turn items: promote matcha and loose-leaf green tea with ceramic bowl bundles; highlight seaweed and pickled ginger as affordable add-ons. Encourage haggling but maintain minimum acceptable margins: generally no sales below cost + $1 unless it opens a larger sale. Prepare a small promotional sample of green tea to include with purchases over $20 (use existing stock if needed). During the day, watch customer activity and be ready to adjust bundles or offer small concessions to close sales. Keep a close eye on cash to ensure next-day entry fee is covered."}

Plan saved. It will remain available during the next market session.
